{"unit_id":"hongcha-dsh__dsh-watchlist#card-zh","repo":"hongcha-dsh/dsh-watchlist","commit":"2a9ef3a079d676b8b1b42e97c2a92fd5a614f838","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-watchlist 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 会话关注插件：它在侧边栏工作区上方显示关注列表，并在输入框旁提供关注开关。列表展示未读、等待、失败、运行和空闲状态，按活动时间排序并将运行中的会话排在后面；可直接打开会话、标记未读或取消关注。适合同时跟进多个 DSH 对话的用户。关注状态保存在浏览器 localStorage，无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:782-789","client.js:1031-1076","client.js:1381-1518"]}
{"unit_id":"hongcha-dsh__dsh-watchlist#card-en","repo":"hongcha-dsh/dsh-watchlist","commit":"2a9ef3a079d676b8b1b42e97c2a92fd5a614f838","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-watchlist adds a watchlist panel to the DSH Web sidebar and a follow toggle by the composer. It shows unread, waiting, failed, running, or idle status; recent activity sorts first and running sessions last. Open, unfollow, or mark a conversation unread. State stays in browser localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:782-789","client.js:1031-1076","client.js:1381-1518"]}
